              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Od-dur 36.1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan Yosia, ka ilma Yohazi jed'ani, ka fulla abba isa hayyu Yuda tahe, AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u: Inni ya armaa deeme deebie asi indeebiu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni lafa iti boojiani keesati dua, deebie lafa tana inargu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
